# Adversarial-fleet scratch reproductions (regenerated per round)
backend/fleet*_repros/

# Isolated worktrees for the adversarial review agents. Each is a FULL
# nested checkout of this repo (~8MB) created by `git worktree add` and
# removed when its round ends, so committing one would vendor the repo
# into itself — and it can be locked and in use while a round is still
# running. Tooling scratch, never project state.
.claude/worktrees/
